{"id": null, "n": "0081c1101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0081c1101", "type": "add", "text": "志【CB】【麗-CB】，支【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0081c1102", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0081c1102", "type": "add", "text": "「菩提流支」為元魏人物，而本經在唐朝譯出，所以「菩提流志」為正確，故依麗本修訂。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0083c1101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0083c1101", "type": "add", "text": "當【CB】【麗-CB】，常【大】"}
